 * Verify a compact JWS and return its raw (still undecoded) payload bytes.
 *
 * @param {string|Uint8Array} token the compact serialisation
 * @param {string|Uint8Array|Map<string, *>|object|Array<*>} key the shared
 *   secret, or a list of candidate secrets (any one of which may match)
 * @param {Array<string>|string|null} [algorithms] algorithms the caller is
 *   willing to accept; `null` means "do not restrict"
